---
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <span class="footer-logo">LX Cult(ure)</span>
      <p class="footer-desc">
        Os melhores eventos culturais de Lisboa, todas as semanas na sua caixa de correio.
        Curadoria baseada em críticas. Para quem vive a cidade.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="/">Esta Semana</a>
      <a href="/arquivo">Arquivo</a>
      <a href="#subscrever">Subscrever</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-copy">
      <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} LX Cult(ure). Lisboa.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    background: var(--cor-fundo-escuro);
    color: var(--cor-texto-claro);
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-lg);
    margin-top: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .footer-logo {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .footer-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
    max-width: 28rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .footer-links a {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--cor-texto-claro);
    opacity: 0.7;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    opacity: 1;
    color: var(--cor-amarelo);
  }

  .footer-copy {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding-top: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .footer-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
